{
  "name": "Elemental Defense: Shroud of Water",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you gain access to this element, you can surround yourself with a shroud of water, ice, or both that protects you from harm, which lasts until you dismiss the effect (no action required).</p><p>While this effect is active and you are not wearing any armor or shield, your AC equals 12 + your Dexterity modifier + your Charisma modifier.</p><p>This effect is exclusive with Elemental Defense class features from other Elemental Schools.</p>",
